                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the single highest-ROI D2C growth tactic in 2026?</h3>
                                        <p>Creative volume. 30-100+ new variants/month per SKU family compounds harder than any single tactic. Combine with WhatsApp lifecycle + subscription default for compounding effect.</p>
                                        <h3>Are referral programs still worth building?</h3>
                                        <p>For strong emotional-purchase categories (beauty, wellness, community-driven brands): yes. For generic D2C: no — payback typically doesn't justify.</p>
